flowchart TD
  START([User: onboard dataset]) --> ROUTER{Router: workloads/}

  ROUTER -->|Found| EXIST[Use / modify existing]
  ROUTER -->|Partial| PART[Complete or restart]
  ROUTER -->|Not found| P0

  PART --> P0
  EXIST --> P0

  P0[Phase 0: AWS + MCP health] -->|Fail| SETUP[Environment Setup]
  P0 -->|Pass| P1

  P1[Phase 1: Human discovery answers] --> P2
  P2[Phase 2: Dedup + plan approval] -->|No| P1
  P2 -->|Yes| P3

  P3[Phase 3: Profile + Metadata Agent + tests] --> CONFIRM{Human confirms?}
  CONFIRM -->|No| P3
  CONFIRM -->|Yes| P4

  P4[Phase 4: Transform / Quality / DAG agents + test gates] --> APPROVE{Approve artifacts?}
  APPROVE -->|No| P4
  APPROVE -->|Yes| P5

  P5[Phase 5: MCP deploy + verify] --> E2E{E2E test?}
  E2E --> DEVOPS{DevOps offer?}
  DEVOPS --> GIT[Commit to Git]
  GIT --> PROMOTE[CI/CD QA → Staging → Prod]
  PROMOTE --> RUN[Runtime: Bronze → Silver → Gold]
